# Default for money coming in when no rule below matches (hledger's own
# default would be income:unknown). Deliberately left undeclared in accounts.journal
# so `hledger check -s` fails until every such posting is re-categorized.
# Outflows fall through to hledger's default, expenses:unknown, which is
# likewise undeclared.
if %amount ^[^-]
    account2 revenue:unknown

if CO SECRETARY STATE FEE
    account2 expenses:fees:government

if DIVIDEND RECEIVED .* \((.*)\) \((Cash|Margin)\)
    account2 revenue:dividends:\1

# Settles the itemized invoice from bin/hetzner-invoice.py (in hetzner.journal).
if Hetzner
    account2 liabilities:accounts-payable:hetzner

if NAME-CHEAP
    account2 expenses:domains:namecheap

if TWILIO SENDGRID
    account2 expenses:communication:sendgrid

if MIGADU
    account2 expenses:communication:migadu

# GitHub Sponsors (arp242, GoatCounter, neovim, ...) — paying for support of
# projects we depend on, so booked as donations rather than dev tooling.
if GITHUB
    account2 expenses:donations

if GOOGLE Workspace
GOOGLE \*Workspace
    account2 expenses:communication:google-workspace

if BACKBLAZE
    account2 expenses:backup:backblaze

if UPTIMEROBOT
    account2 expenses:monitoring:uptimerobot

if FOREIGN TRANSACTION FEE
    account2 expenses:fees:foreign-transaction

if CO SECRETARY STATE FEE
    account2 expenses:fees:government
